   transfer ownership.

2. Grant of License

   A non-exclusive, non-transferable right to use the Toolkit is granted
   to customers holding a valid agreement with IB Leaders (the "Licensee"),
   limited to:

   a. Internal use for migrating IBSheet7-based source code that the
      Licensee lawfully owns to IBSheet8;
   b. Installation and execution within the Licensee's development
      environment;
   c. Authoring configuration (migrate.config.json) and extending
      migration rules (engine/rules/) to fit the Licensee's conventions.

3. Deployment of the Bridge Helper (Important)

   `helpers/ibsheet-migration.js` is a runtime file invoked by the output
   the Toolkit produces. Within the scope of Section 2, the Licensee may:

   a. Copy and deploy this file into the Licensee's web application;
   b. Modify it to fit project requirements (conflicts arising from
      Toolkit updates are the Licensee's responsibility).

   Standalone redistribution of this file to third parties, unrelated to
   use of the Toolkit, is not permitted.

