6. Disclaimer of Warranty and Limitation of Liability

   THE TOOLKIT IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS
   OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.

   The Toolkit performs static code migration and consistency verification
   (residue scan, syntax check, function parity). It does not guarantee
   runtime behavior of the migrated output. The Licensee is responsible for:

   a. Browser-level QA of the migrated output;
   b. Backend (server controllers, mapper SQL) verification and development;
   c. Confirming deployment of the bridge helper — the three verification
      scripts are static checks and cannot detect a missing deployment;
   d. Backing up original source code.

   IB Leaders shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, or incidental
   damages arising from use of or inability to use the Toolkit.

